window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>In this book, you'll see characters from the Secret Worlds Series.</i></b></p> <p><b>Lucifer's the first vampire in existence, a true vampire, born. He's missing something in his life, he's missing his blood-mate.</b><br> <br> Lucifer Fraydon's spent his entire life keeping his world a secret from humans. He and two others created CIRS. That being said, he lost his blood-mate when he was quite young, and hasn't found another since. His had been murdered by a human, which makes it even harder for him to trust humans. He's professional, and very much so in every part of his life. He also hold secrets from his past. Now, his life's being turned upside when a carefree but cautious specimen crashes into his life.</p> <p><b>Graham has been struggling his whole life; he doesn't ask for handouts and he takes care of himself.</b><br> <br> Graham wasn't expecting to be in Kelowna BC longer than a week tops, but after being attacked by a mutated dog and a cannibal human, he's forced to go to the hospital for treatment. He doesn't expect to be sucked into a world he was told didn't exist. In fact, he thought that only his kind existed, which he'd only learned a year prior. Now, he's trusting and falling for one of the very things he didn't know existed.</p>"; 
